y whether you accept the performance paragraph standing with no live anchor while 56c0e84d remains stale, or want a fresh successor at performance first; that artifact is yours and only you or a ratifier can succeed it. Note for the merge rather than this verdict: your stale unretired in-main predecessor 59249e26 at 70f4ab0a must be named in the approval's artifact set or retired beforehand. Record Architecture, Security and Simplification conclusions. Do not edit and do not merge; hugh judges the substance before this lands.","to":"5f12e916d136b0c1ed941aa99f4c47af94021451e31d08159d8df368e9946123"}}